{
    "title": "Scores App: NFL Football 2024",
    "description": "Are you tired of cluttered sports apps that leave you guessing about the latest football scores and NFL stats? Look no further! Our Scores App delivers lightning-fast updates including real-time stats & play-by-play, ensuring you never miss a moment of the action.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Live NFL scores and real-time plays to keep you in the action.\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Lightning-fast updates, including full play-by-play and stats.\r\n\ud83d\udce2 Immediate game notifications for scores, close games, overtime, and more!\r\n\ud83c\udfc8 Up-to-the-minute team & player boxscore stats.\r\n\ud83d\ude91 Team depth-charts with daily injury updates.\r\n\ud83d\udcc8 NFL season stats for teams and players, with leaders in passing, rushing, receiving, and more!\r\n\ud83d\udcfa Game previews: matchup stats, TV channels, and weather!\r\n\ud83d\udcb0 Game odds including first & second half lines and quarters. Point spread, money line, and over-under.\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Betting trends and previous game results for each line scope & line type.\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Stay updated on the playoff picture with team standings by division and conference.\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 Customize your schedule: filter by team, division, or conference.\r\n\u23f0 Never miss a game with customizable alarms.\r\n\ud83d\udcf0 Access NFL news for the league and your favorite teams on the go.\r\n\ud83c\udf10 No internet connection? No problem! Full football schedule is available offline.\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Easily check scores from past NFL games.\r\n\ud83d\udcc6 Includes the 2024 NFL football schedule, with postseason games automatically added.\r\n\r\nAll NFL teams are included, including the National Football Conference and American Football Conference. Teams for all division are included. In the NFC East there are the Dallas Cowboys, Washington Commanders, New York Giants, & Philadelphia Eagles. The NFC North contains the Chicago Bears, Green Bay Packers, Detroit Lions, & Minnesota Vikings. In the NFC South there are the Tampa Bay Buccaneers, Atlanta Falcons, Carolina Panthers, & New Orleans Saints. Over in the NFC West there are the San Francisco 49ers, the Los Angeles Rams, the Seattle Seahawks, and the Arizona Cardinals.  In the AFC East there are the New England Patriots, Buffalo Bills, New York Jets, & Miami Dolphins. The AFC North contains the Pittsburgh Steelers, Cleveland Browns, Cincinnati Bengals, & Baltimore Ravens. In the AFC South there are the Jacksonville Jaguars, Houston Texans, Tennessee Titans, & Indianapolis Colts. Over in the AFC West there are the San Diego Chargers, Las Vegas Raiders, Denver Broncos, & Kansas City Chiefs. \r\n\r\nPlayoff & postseason games will be automatically added as they are scheduled, including the wildcard round, divisional round, conference championships, and the Super Bowl.\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy:\r\nhttps://www.scoresapp.com/privacy\r\n\r\nPlease note: \r\nThis app is not endorsed by or affiliated with the National Football League. Any trademarks used in the app are done so under \"fair use\" with the sole purpose of identifying the respective entities, and remain the property of their respective owners.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you tired of cluttered sports apps that leave you guessing about the latest football scores and NFL stats? Look no further! Our Scores App delivers lightning-fast updates including real-time stats &amp; play-by-play, ensuring you never miss a moment of the action.<br><br>Key Features:<br>\ud83d\udd25 Live NFL scores and real-time plays to keep you in the action.<br>\ud83d\ude80 Lightning-fast updates, including full play-by-play and stats.<br>\ud83d\udce2 Immediate game notifications for scores, close games, overtime, and more!<br>\ud83c\udfc8 Up-to-the-minute team &amp; player boxscore stats.<br>\ud83d\ude91 Team depth-charts with daily injury updates.<br>\ud83d\udcc8 NFL season stats for teams and players, with leaders in passing, rushing, receiving, and more!<br>\ud83d\udcfa Game previews: matchup stats, TV channels, and weather!<br>\ud83d\udcb0 Game odds including first &amp; second half lines and quarters. Point spread, money line, and over-under.<br>\ud83d\udcb2 Betting trends and previous game results for each line scope &amp; line type.<br>\ud83c\udfc6 Stay updated on the playoff picture with team standings by division and conference.<br>\ud83d\udcc5 Customize your schedule: filter by team, division, or conference.<br>\u23f0 Never miss a game with customizable alarms.<br>\ud83d\udcf0 Access NFL news for the league and your favorite teams on the go.<br>\ud83c\udf10 No internet connection? No problem! Full football schedule is available offline.<br>\ud83d\udd04 Easily check scores from past NFL games.<br>\ud83d\udcc6 Includes the 2024 NFL football schedule, with postseason games automatically added.<br><br>All NFL teams are included, including the National Football Conference and American Football Conference. Teams for all division are included. In the NFC East there are the Dallas Cowboys, Washington Commanders, New York Giants, &amp; Philadelphia Eagles. The NFC North contains the Chicago Bears, Green Bay Packers, Detroit Lions, &amp; Minnesota Vikings. In the NFC South there are the Tampa Bay Buccaneers, Atlanta Falcons, Carolina Panthers, &amp; New Orleans Saints. Over in the NFC West there are the San Francisco 49ers, the Los Angeles Rams, the Seattle Seahawks, and the Arizona Cardinals.  In the AFC East there are the New England Patriots, Buffalo Bills, New York Jets, &amp; Miami Dolphins. The AFC North contains the Pittsburgh Steelers, Cleveland Browns, Cincinnati Bengals, &amp; Baltimore Ravens. In the AFC South there are the Jacksonville Jaguars, Houston Texans, Tennessee Titans, &amp; Indianapolis Colts. Over in the AFC West there are the San Diego Chargers, Las Vegas Raiders, Denver Broncos, &amp; Kansas City Chiefs. <br><br>Playoff &amp; postseason games will be automatically added as they are scheduled, including the wildcard round, divisional round, conference championships, and the Super Bowl.<br><br>Privacy Policy:<br>https://www.scoresapp.com/privacy<br><br>Please note: <br>This app is not endorsed by or affiliated with the National Football League. Any trademarks used in the app are done so under &quot;fair use&quot; with the sole purpose of identifying the respective entities, and remain the property of their respective owners.",
